error[E0411]: `str` has no character indexing
 --> mem:///main.lu:3:16
  |
3 |     let last = s[^1]
  |                ^^^^^ no `s[^1]` on `str`
  |
  = note: a single position cannot honestly name a character (D25); the end-relative slices are
    `s[^n..]` (last `n` bytes) and `s[..^n]` (all but the last `n`).
